{"id":"desgracia","lemma":"desgracia","pos":"noun","rank":1487,"glosses":["disgrace","misfortune, bad luck","accident, disaster"],"ipa":"/desˈɡɾaθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"desgracias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-desgracia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Por desgracia no nos queda otra opción.","en":"I'm afraid we have no choice.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831474","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"curfew"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},{"g":"option"}]},{"text":"¡Qué desgracia!","en":"What rotten luck!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443425","words":[{"g":"what"},null]},{"text":"Aquel que no conoce del amor no conoce de desgracias.","en":"One who knows no love knows no unhappiness.","words":[{"g":"that (over there"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"love"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Por desgracia, mi cumpleaños sólo ocurre una vez al año.","en":"Unfortunately, my birthday is only once a year.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691785","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"my"},{"g":"birthday"},null,{"g":"to happen, to occur","l":"ocurrir"},null,null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"year"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"once"]]},{"text":"Por desgracia, murió mucha gente.","en":"Sadly, many people died.","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"people"}]}]}